MODULE: SagaEventuallyCompletesOrRefusesExpiryNeverRuns
TARGET: SagaEventuallyCompletesOrRefuses
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: quiesce expiry and its shutdown alternative never settle a waiting saga
PERTURBS: SagaRefuse, ShutdownDrain

